 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kono koi, okuchi ni aimasu ka?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "この恋、おくちにあいますか?"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Kono koi, okuchi ni aimasu ka?"
   },
   {
    "en": "Does the love suit your taste?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Nobody even tries to understand me... I, Toui Kiminami, known as the number one troublemaker in school, have a dream for the future. And for that dream, I don’t give a damn about anything else.\nBut one day, everything changes when my father forces me into an arranged marriage. Her name is Lila Shirahime, the most beautiful girl in school and the top student, daughter of a company president and a popular model known as “S-Hime.”\nEverything about her is the complete opposite of me.\nWith a true nature very different from her outward appearance, she gets in the way of my dreams and even threatens to kiss me every single day, taking it upon herself to reform me.\nThis is bad. I need to do something about her quickly for the sake of my future…\nBut it seems even the seemingly perfect and unbeatable Shirahime has circumstances forcing her to be that way…"
  },
